The O-Net packet codec in `src/pyoase/onet.py` is a clean-room re-implementation of
the wire protocol used by the MIT-licensed ioBroker.oasecontrol adapter
(https://github.com/mr-suw/ioBroker.oasecontrol, Copyright (c) mrsuw), which was used
as the protocol reference. No source code was copied; only the wire format (packet
framing, opcodes, and the FM-Master socket scene payloads) was reproduced from the
observable protocol behavior.

